00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:52,360
But a little later on this year is the contract that I have for

192
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:58,040
an app provider runs out. it will stop being maintained and updated

193
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:02,600
And, like a lot of people, I pretty much abandoned Google Plus as a social

194
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,880
media platform.

195
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:09,000
The audience was relatively small and not very active,

196
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:14,160
So the effort required to keep that up has been experiencing diminishing returns.

197
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,400
Google Plus- remember Google Plus?

198
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:20,480
Everybody was on it for about a day and a half, but well, listen,

