00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:38,360
In the past few months, I've been going through over 1800 posts that have accumulated

204
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,760
in the past 10 years.

205
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:44,440
Many are still relevant, but some offer either dated information or

