00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:57,360
And they get a lot of play over on Facebook.

211
00:13:57,360 --> 00:14:00,600
But in the coming year I'm going to continue publishing the blog,

212
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:04,000
but probably with what will seem like fewer articles,

213
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:07,240
probably one at most two new articles a week,

214
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,880
And there's a couple of reasons for this.

215
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:12,320
If you've ever looked into blogging, it's a really interesting field.

216
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:16,600
Trends and standard practices have come and gone,

217
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:21,040
but the single immutable truth in blogging is that great content draws

218
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,640
and maintains and grows an audience.

219
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:26,800
Now there are a lot of days when I'm pretty sure I have written nearly

220
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,760
everything I can about scouting,

221
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:33,560
And it's a stretch to come up with new ideas or new ways to look at old ideas,

222
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:37,520
And if you look back at old posts you'll find a lot of repetitive information.

223
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:41,640
So I want to keep things engaging and valuable, expect to see fewer,

224
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:46,920
but what I hope are higher quality articles over the next year.

